Modified by pleware (https://github.com/pleware/zest) into the box-side P2P
model-distribution daemon for PWare OS / initagent. The modifications add:
private swarm mode, manifest-pinned digest validation, a pull task manager with
a REST + SSE surface, resumable downloads, and per-file (GGUF) selection.

